## Interface: 16001
## Title: EnchantQuex
## Notes: Shows the expected disenchant value of items, priced with Auctionator scan data, and adds a Disenchant tab to the auction house listing items worth buying to disenchant. In trades, scroll over the "Will not be traded" item to cycle enchants. Click the minimap button for the trade ledger, right-click to edit material tables.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Trade_Engraving
## Author: Lucas Taubert
## Version: 0.2.0
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator
## SavedVariables: EnchantQuexDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: EnchantQuexCharDB

